1
00:01:32,729 --> 00:01:34,920
[OVERDO]

2
00:01:35,479 --> 00:01:37,729
[Episode 27]

3
00:01:48,039 --> 00:01:50,240
Here they come. The newlyweds are here.

4
00:01:56,120 --> 00:01:57,150
How nice.

5
00:02:22,079 --> 00:02:22,680
Come here.

6
00:02:25,079 --> 00:02:26,140
What are you doing?

7
00:02:28,400 --> 00:02:29,400
What's going on?

8
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:30,840
Who is this?

9
00:02:30,840 --> 00:02:32,030
Who is this person?

10
00:02:33,430 --> 00:02:34,120
Let me go!

11
00:02:35,190 --> 00:02:36,280
His fiancée?

12
00:02:37,280 --> 00:02:38,480
For this first dance,

13
00:02:39,190 --> 00:02:40,030
dance with me.

14
00:02:50,750 --> 00:02:52,680
-Where's Le'an?
-What's going on?

15
00:02:53,590 --> 00:02:54,320
Don't worry.

16
00:02:54,800 --> 00:02:56,000
He's perfectly safe.

17
00:03:00,030 --> 00:03:02,090
Ye Zhihong is the woman Qingyu loves.

18
00:03:04,360 --> 00:03:05,080
So what?

19
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:09,060
What right do you have to question me?

20
00:03:10,520 --> 00:03:11,520
Or

21
00:03:13,120 --> 00:03:14,320
are you just jealous?

22
00:03:18,050 --> 00:03:22,200
♪ In those fleeting
three seconds of twilight ♪

23
00:03:18,590 --> 00:03:20,920
You're simply impossible to reason with.

24
00:03:24,130 --> 00:03:27,980
♪ An amber dream shimmers
within the glass ♪

25
00:03:30,220 --> 00:03:34,350
♪ The ice of loneliness
melts away in the warmth ♪

26
00:03:33,400 --> 00:03:34,860
I've showed up as promised

27
00:03:36,310 --> 00:03:38,079
and witnessed your absurd wedding.

28
00:03:36,780 --> 00:03:39,980
♪ Your evasive gaze
gives your heart away ♪

29
00:03:39,240 --> 00:03:41,040
Can I take Le'an away with me now?

30
00:03:42,570 --> 00:03:46,460
♪ Don't tell me ♪

31
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:46,710
Thank you all

32
00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:48,680
for attending our wedding today.

33
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:51,660
♪ You're tired again; this time, don't ♪

34
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:51,000
The one beside me

35
00:03:53,190 --> 00:03:55,950
♪ Don't push me away
only to draw me close ♪

36
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:55,400
is the one I'm going to marry.

37
00:03:56,040 --> 00:03:57,440
♪ Why so nervous? ♪

38
00:03:56,560 --> 00:03:58,000
W-What's this about?

39
00:03:58,000 --> 00:03:59,150
What's going on?

40
00:03:58,130 --> 00:04:01,150
♪ Please don't stay frozen for too long ♪

41
00:04:00,360 --> 00:04:01,560
What's going on?

42
00:04:01,840 --> 00:04:03,680
Isn't that his elder brother's
former fiancée?

43
00:04:01,910 --> 00:04:03,950
♪ Say my name ♪

44
00:04:03,680 --> 00:04:04,310
Exactly.

45
00:04:04,840 --> 00:04:06,080
Although the dead
cannot be brought back to life,

46
00:04:05,430 --> 00:04:07,360
♪ Please don't stop ♪

47
00:04:06,080 --> 00:04:07,960
it's still quite rare for someone
to marry his own sister-in-law.

48
00:04:07,540 --> 00:04:11,530
♪ Forgive me, I've loved you for ages ♪

49
00:04:07,960 --> 00:04:09,400
-Exactly.
-Yeah.

50
00:04:11,840 --> 00:04:13,430
That's just too undignified.

51
00:04:13,400 --> 00:04:15,960
♪ Please lull me into absolute surrender ♪

52
00:04:16,060 --> 00:04:19,350
♪ Before you cage me
in a prison of your design ♪

53
00:04:18,560 --> 00:04:19,829
The times are turbulent.

54
00:04:19,829 --> 00:04:24,060
♪ Stop bowing to the crowd ♪

55
00:04:20,390 --> 00:04:22,250
So we'll keep everything simple.

56
00:04:25,830 --> 00:04:27,430
Miss Fang will come visit you again
tomorrow.

57
00:04:25,860 --> 00:04:28,920
♪ Conquer to be free ♪

58
00:04:27,920 --> 00:04:29,240
Just give it to her then.

59
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:30,190
If you wait any longer,

60
00:04:30,190 --> 00:04:32,070
I'm afraid you'll rub the surface off.

61
00:04:30,230 --> 00:04:32,810
♪ Even if I'm unrepentantly obsessed ♪

62
00:04:32,930 --> 00:04:35,290
♪ I'll let the wrongs just carry on ♪

63
00:04:32,950 --> 00:04:34,190
What do you know?

64
00:04:34,720 --> 00:04:36,310
A ring is a precious item.

65
00:04:36,310 --> 00:04:38,190
Of course I have to
pick a good day to give it to her.

66
00:04:37,840 --> 00:04:41,130
♪ Drunk and unawakened,
waves rage stronger ♪

67
00:04:42,300 --> 00:04:45,760
♪ Let them rage, let them rise ♪

68
00:04:45,790 --> 00:04:48,320
♪ Drench me through ♪

69
00:04:49,670 --> 00:04:53,330
♪ No matter how many words I got wrong,
in the end ♪

70
00:04:54,230 --> 00:04:57,470
♪ I never had what I longed for ♪

71
00:04:57,490 --> 00:05:00,420
♪ Only a receding tide ♪

72
00:05:01,730 --> 00:05:06,400
♪ Just you and me, all else fades away ♪

73
00:05:05,190 --> 00:05:06,870
Consider today our wedding.

74
00:05:21,830 --> 00:05:22,830
But I heard

75
00:05:22,830 --> 00:05:24,720
this woman has a 6-year-old child.

76
00:05:24,720 --> 00:05:25,750
Really?

77
00:05:27,070 --> 00:05:27,800
Absurd.

78
00:05:28,830 --> 00:05:29,390
Mother!

79
00:05:34,040 --> 00:05:34,680
Laiyi.

80
00:05:36,040 --> 00:05:37,240
Take her to see Le'an.

81
00:05:42,600 --> 00:05:43,430
Don't leave!

82
00:05:43,580 --> 00:05:44,170
What a mess.

83
00:05:44,170 --> 00:05:44,790
Exactly.

84
00:05:45,950 --> 00:05:48,010
Whoever acknowledges this marriage

85
00:05:48,070 --> 00:05:50,270
is making an enemy of our Murong family!

86
00:05:53,040 --> 00:05:54,000
Murong Qingyi!

87
00:05:56,040 --> 00:05:58,700
So this is the wedding banquet
you invited me to?

88
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:01,640
Do you want our Murong family

89
00:06:02,800 --> 00:06:05,460
to become the laughingstock
of all of Nancheng?

90
00:06:06,950 --> 00:06:08,560
She was Qingyu's fiancée.

91
00:06:09,600 --> 00:06:10,160
You...

92
00:06:11,360 --> 00:06:13,160
How could you touch her?

93
00:06:18,390 --> 00:06:19,920
I've told you time and again

94
00:06:20,630 --> 00:06:21,630
that she's not Fang Mulan.

95
00:06:21,630 --> 00:06:22,720
She's Ren Susu.

96
00:06:23,800 --> 00:06:24,800
She always has been.

97
00:06:24,800 --> 00:06:27,360
I don't care
whether her surname is Fang or Ren.

98
00:06:27,360 --> 00:06:29,000
She was Qingyu's fiancée.

99
00:06:31,190 --> 00:06:31,990
She was the one

100
00:06:32,470 --> 00:06:34,310
who was betrothed to Qingyu,

101
00:06:34,630 --> 00:06:37,890
the one who performed
the hair-binding ceremony with him,

102
00:06:37,920 --> 00:06:38,360
and in the end,

103
00:06:38,360 --> 00:06:41,000
the one who observed the funeral rites
for him.

104
00:06:42,680 --> 00:06:43,630
You must never

105
00:06:44,720 --> 00:06:46,630
touch this woman in your life!

106
00:06:51,920 --> 00:06:54,580
The one who was engaged to Qingyu
was Fang Mulan.

107
00:06:55,159 --> 00:06:55,600
Fang Mulan wasn't the only one

108
00:06:55,600 --> 00:06:58,000
who observed the funeral rites for Qingyu.

109
00:06:59,310 --> 00:07:01,110
And the hair-binding ceremony?

110
00:07:05,560 --> 00:07:07,560
The one who performed that ceremony
with her back then

111
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:08,240
was me.

112
00:07:16,350 --> 00:07:20,790
♪ Forgive me, I've loved you for ages ♪

113
00:07:22,440 --> 00:07:25,160
♪ Please lull me into absolute surrender ♪

114
00:07:25,300 --> 00:07:28,010
♪ Before you cage me
in a prison of your design ♪

115
00:07:27,360 --> 00:07:28,240
You bastard.

116
00:07:28,830 --> 00:07:32,970
♪ Stop bowing to the crowd ♪

117
00:07:32,430 --> 00:07:33,430
They said

118
00:07:34,480 --> 00:07:35,600
she has a son.

119
00:07:35,220 --> 00:07:37,980
♪ Conquer to be free ♪

120
00:07:37,870 --> 00:07:38,800
Whose child

121
00:07:39,390 --> 00:07:42,070
♪ Even if I'm unrepentantly obsessed ♪

122
00:07:39,920 --> 00:07:41,190
is he, exactly?

123
00:07:42,190 --> 00:07:44,360
♪ I'll let the wrongs just carry on ♪

124
00:07:43,430 --> 00:07:44,720
Tell me!

125
00:07:46,120 --> 00:07:47,310
Whose else could it be?

126
00:07:47,050 --> 00:07:50,290
♪ Drunk and unawakened,
waves rage stronger ♪

127
00:07:50,750 --> 00:07:51,240
Mother...

128
00:07:51,240 --> 00:07:52,310
Murong Qingyi.

129
00:07:51,440 --> 00:07:54,820
♪ Surging in, pushing out ♪

130
00:07:53,800 --> 00:07:55,430
If you insist on marrying her,

131
00:07:54,950 --> 00:07:57,690
♪ Drench me through ♪

132
00:07:57,360 --> 00:07:58,820
then from this day onward,

133
00:07:59,080 --> 00:08:03,180
♪ Say it out loud that you own me ♪

134
00:07:59,830 --> 00:08:02,430
you're no longer a member
of the Murong family!

135
00:08:11,720 --> 00:08:12,630
Besides her,

136
00:08:14,040 --> 00:08:15,440
is there anyone else here

137
00:08:15,720 --> 00:08:17,190
who opposes this marriage?

138
00:08:17,190 --> 00:08:18,720
-Congratulations, Principal.
-Congratulations, Principal.

139
00:08:18,370 --> 00:08:19,950
♪ It's so turbulent
I'm afraid I'll get drunk ♪

140
00:08:18,920 --> 00:08:20,120
-Congratulations, Principal.
-Congratulations, Principal.

141
00:08:20,030 --> 00:08:20,890
♪ If I have a dream, let me get drunk ♪

142
00:08:20,120 --> 00:08:21,160
Congratulations, Young Marshal Murong.

143
00:08:20,960 --> 00:08:22,920
♪ It's so turbulent
I'm afraid it'll shatter ♪

144
00:08:21,160 --> 00:08:22,240
Congratulations, Principal.

145
00:08:22,240 --> 00:08:23,560
Congratulations, Young Marshal Murong.

146
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:24,100
♪ It shatters at the slightest touch ♪

147
00:08:24,200 --> 00:08:27,270
♪ Bittersweet ♪

148
00:08:24,750 --> 00:08:26,480
Congratulations, Principal.

149
00:08:26,600 --> 00:08:27,270
Mother.

150
00:08:27,800 --> 00:08:29,000
Look at these people.

151
00:08:28,880 --> 00:08:31,310
♪ I beg you, don't let me ♪

152
00:08:29,240 --> 00:08:31,430
Do they even have any respect left
for our Murong family?

153
00:08:31,420 --> 00:08:33,169
♪ Suffer this endless pain ♪

154
00:08:36,510 --> 00:08:39,570
♪ No matter how many words I got wrong,
in the end ♪

155
00:08:40,669 --> 00:08:41,390
Let's go.

156
00:08:40,950 --> 00:08:44,270
♪ I never had what I longed for ♪

157
00:08:44,340 --> 00:08:47,120
♪ Only a receding tide ♪

158
00:08:48,470 --> 00:08:52,940
♪ Just you and me, all else fades away ♪

159
00:08:49,390 --> 00:08:51,120
Go investigate this child's background.

160
00:08:51,120 --> 00:08:52,550
We have to get to the bottom of this.

161
00:08:52,550 --> 00:08:53,480
Okay. Got it.

162
00:09:18,560 --> 00:09:24,220
[Lanxin Theater]

163
00:09:54,200 --> 00:09:55,120
Murong Qingyi.

164
00:10:01,120 --> 00:10:02,780
I have something to say to you.

165
00:10:11,550 --> 00:10:12,880
Give me an explanation.

166
00:10:18,510 --> 00:10:19,960
Le'an needs a father.

167
00:10:21,240 --> 00:10:22,790
He needs a complete family.

168
00:10:23,440 --> 00:10:24,300
Is that enough?

169
00:10:24,550 --> 00:10:27,080
So you're using Le'an
to force me to marry you?

170
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:29,620
Did you even ask what we think?

171
00:10:30,910 --> 00:10:32,910
You're still just as stubborn as ever,

172
00:10:32,910 --> 00:10:34,970
always making decisions on your own.

173
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:39,860
But you must promise me one thing.

174
00:10:40,080 --> 00:10:41,240
Once I've made up my mind,

175
00:10:41,240 --> 00:10:42,390
I'll ask you to do something for me,

176
00:10:42,390 --> 00:10:43,720
and you must not refuse.

177
00:10:45,550 --> 00:10:46,840
I swear to heaven.

178
00:10:49,670 --> 00:10:50,790
You promised me

179
00:10:52,120 --> 00:10:54,050
that I could ask you to do one thing.

180
00:10:54,600 --> 00:10:55,720
This marriage—

181
00:10:56,150 --> 00:10:57,320
you must accept it.

182
00:10:57,320 --> 00:10:58,780
I accept it. And then what?

183
00:10:59,000 --> 00:11:01,120
Make Le'an accept you as his father,

184
00:11:01,390 --> 00:11:02,910
and then we live happily as a family?

185
00:11:02,910 --> 00:11:03,750
Why not?

186
00:11:04,720 --> 00:11:06,030
If Li Boze could take care of both of you,

187
00:11:06,030 --> 00:11:07,080
then why can't I?

188
00:11:07,670 --> 00:11:09,400
I'm Le'an's father, after all.

189
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:11,240
How do you expect Le'an to accept

190
00:11:11,240 --> 00:11:12,440
a father who's been gone for 6 years?

191
00:11:12,440 --> 00:11:13,840
If you never tell Le'an I'm his father,

192
00:11:13,840 --> 00:11:16,240
how do you know
he won't be able to accept it?

193
00:11:20,750 --> 00:11:21,600
Ren Susu.

194
00:11:22,790 --> 00:11:24,520
Do you really hate me that much?

195
00:11:26,440 --> 00:11:28,500
You were the one who said you hated me,

196
00:11:28,790 --> 00:11:30,790
that you wished you had never met me.

197
00:11:31,670 --> 00:11:33,510
Given the state of our relationship,

198
00:11:33,510 --> 00:11:35,240
how do you expect me to tell him?

199
00:11:36,840 --> 00:11:37,790
I hate you?

200
00:11:39,320 --> 00:11:40,790
I just refused to give up.

201
00:11:41,600 --> 00:11:43,120
I refused to give up

202
00:11:43,630 --> 00:11:46,360
that tiny bit of hope of
living like a human being.

203
00:11:46,960 --> 00:11:48,240
But now I understand.

204
00:11:50,200 --> 00:11:51,240
Ren Susu,

205
00:11:53,360 --> 00:11:54,550
I hate you.

206
00:12:00,510 --> 00:12:01,200
Fine.

207
00:12:02,510 --> 00:12:03,750
Then from now on,

208
00:12:04,910 --> 00:12:07,710
let's just be a married couple
who hate each other.

209
00:12:09,670 --> 00:12:11,000
Ren Susu, listen.

210
00:12:11,720 --> 00:12:13,000
Le'an is innocent.

211
00:12:14,510 --> 00:12:15,910
Even if it's just an act,

212
00:12:16,270 --> 00:12:19,130
we still have to make it look like
a complete family.

213
00:12:19,200 --> 00:12:20,330
I won't accept that.

214
00:12:21,240 --> 00:12:22,320
You must go through with this marriage!

215
00:12:22,320 --> 00:12:23,030
Let go of me!

216
00:12:23,030 --> 00:12:23,840
Mom.

217
00:12:25,390 --> 00:12:25,960
Let go.

218
00:12:26,080 --> 00:12:26,960
Uncle.

219
00:12:27,080 --> 00:12:28,600
What are you two doing?

220
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:37,630
Le'an.

221
00:12:38,720 --> 00:12:39,960
I'm not your uncle.

222
00:12:40,510 --> 00:12:41,510
I'm your father.

223
00:12:44,200 --> 00:12:44,840
Mom,

224
00:12:44,840 --> 00:12:46,440
is what he said true?

225
00:12:52,910 --> 00:12:54,630
Are you really my father?

226
00:12:56,320 --> 00:12:56,840
Yes,

227
00:12:57,120 --> 00:12:58,320
I am your father.

228
00:12:58,870 --> 00:12:59,870
This is great.

229
00:13:00,030 --> 00:13:01,670
I finally have a father.

230
00:13:10,150 --> 00:13:10,790
Papa, Mama!

231
00:13:10,790 --> 00:13:11,870
Come out quickly!

232
00:13:11,870 --> 00:13:12,270
Susu!

233
00:13:12,270 --> 00:13:13,910
Fire! Come and help put it out!

234
00:13:13,910 --> 00:13:14,840
Susu!

235
00:13:14,910 --> 00:13:15,550
Susu!

236
00:13:15,550 --> 00:13:17,010
Come help put out the fire!

237
00:13:17,320 --> 00:13:18,600
I lost my family,

238
00:13:19,240 --> 00:13:20,840
and he never had a family.

239
00:13:21,600 --> 00:13:22,660
But at this moment,

240
00:13:22,870 --> 00:13:24,510
do we have a chance

241
00:13:25,120 --> 00:13:26,920
to give Le'an a complete family?

242
00:13:27,840 --> 00:13:30,360
How about we go take a family photo?

243
00:13:31,150 --> 00:13:32,270
Mom makes the call.

244
00:13:32,600 --> 00:13:33,600
Mom, Mom.

245
00:13:33,720 --> 00:13:36,000
Can we go take a family photo?

246
00:13:55,080 --> 00:13:56,840
Alright, look here.

247
00:13:57,150 --> 00:13:58,320
Smile.

248
00:14:41,330 --> 00:14:45,130
[Chairman, East Asia Chamber of Commerce]

249
00:14:44,320 --> 00:14:44,910
This...

250
00:14:46,120 --> 00:14:47,200
Is this the drug

251
00:14:47,840 --> 00:14:50,040
that will be sent to Nancheng tomorrow?

252
00:14:50,270 --> 00:14:51,870
Only in its original potency

253
00:14:52,270 --> 00:14:53,840
can it achieve this effect.

254
00:14:54,870 --> 00:14:56,270
The ones sent to Nancheng

255
00:14:57,080 --> 00:14:58,720
will be diluted tenfold,

256
00:14:59,600 --> 00:15:02,120
so the onset of symptoms
and the rate of transmission

257
00:15:02,120 --> 00:15:03,510
will be much slower.

258
00:15:04,240 --> 00:15:05,270
Last time,

259
00:15:05,440 --> 00:15:07,510
you tried to use Fang Youshen's cargo ship

260
00:15:07,510 --> 00:15:08,840
to smuggle the Red Pills

261
00:15:08,870 --> 00:15:10,790
containing the active ingredient,

262
00:15:10,790 --> 00:15:11,550
yet in the end,

263
00:15:11,550 --> 00:15:12,910
all the pills

264
00:15:13,390 --> 00:15:15,910
were destroyed by Fang Youshen.

265
00:15:17,320 --> 00:15:19,000
If this attempt in Nancheng

266
00:15:19,270 --> 00:15:20,630
fails again,

267
00:15:22,340 --> 00:15:24,120
you and your family...

268
00:15:30,440 --> 00:15:31,480
Mr. Zhang.

269
00:15:31,910 --> 00:15:32,870
I know

270
00:15:33,270 --> 00:15:35,630
what you value most is family honor.

271
00:15:36,360 --> 00:15:37,270
If

272
00:15:37,480 --> 00:15:39,740
this batch of drugs is used effectively,

273
00:15:40,320 --> 00:15:41,840
your Zhang family

274
00:15:42,390 --> 00:15:45,550
will be credited with a major achievement.

275
00:15:59,800 --> 00:16:02,310
[Nancheng Station]

276
00:17:25,800 --> 00:17:28,089
[Times Newspaper]

277
00:17:32,240 --> 00:17:32,960
Tao.

278
00:17:33,920 --> 00:17:34,790
Are you sure

279
00:17:35,400 --> 00:17:36,460
you saw it clearly?

280
00:17:36,550 --> 00:17:37,720
Absolutely.

281
00:17:38,310 --> 00:17:40,770
It was the same kind of train
we saw last time.

282
00:17:41,310 --> 00:17:42,720
The cargo that was unloaded

283
00:17:42,720 --> 00:17:43,400
should now be

284
00:17:43,400 --> 00:17:43,830
in the warehouse

285
00:17:43,830 --> 00:17:46,270
at the train station
where the Ying Army is stationed.

286
00:17:46,270 --> 00:17:48,030
That train station is heavily guarded.

287
00:17:48,030 --> 00:17:49,630
How are we supposed to get in?

288
00:17:55,350 --> 00:17:57,400
That's where your expertise comes in.

289
00:17:57,400 --> 00:18:00,600
It's time to go to the train station
to cheer on the troops.

290
00:18:50,070 --> 00:18:52,680
Bravo!

291
00:19:04,880 --> 00:19:07,030
Here it is.

292
00:19:22,810 --> 00:19:24,400
What's going on?

293
00:19:25,160 --> 00:19:26,160
Exactly.

294
00:19:26,210 --> 00:19:27,350
What's this about?

295
00:19:27,480 --> 00:19:28,270
Why did they stop performing?

296
00:19:28,270 --> 00:19:29,240
They were performing just fine.

297
00:19:29,240 --> 00:19:29,790
Exactly.

298
00:19:37,640 --> 00:19:38,500
Where are they?

299
00:19:38,740 --> 00:19:39,380
-Where are they?
-They're gone.

300
00:19:39,380 --> 00:19:40,380
Where did they go?

301
00:19:41,310 --> 00:19:42,840
That's really impressive!

302
00:19:44,440 --> 00:19:45,400
Impressive.

303
00:19:49,000 --> 00:19:50,270
Look. Look over there.

304
00:19:58,240 --> 00:19:59,030
Bravo!

305
00:20:02,200 --> 00:20:03,030
Bravo! Amazing!

306
00:20:03,030 --> 00:20:04,030
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

307
00:20:11,700 --> 00:20:16,360
[Confirmed the Zhang family sent someone
to the station. Tracking continues.]

308
00:20:15,400 --> 00:20:16,200
As expected,

309
00:20:16,880 --> 00:20:19,310
the Zhang family sent someone
to the train station.

310
00:20:19,310 --> 00:20:21,920
Send someone to keep an eye
on the train station.

311
00:20:21,920 --> 00:20:22,790
If there's any movement,

312
00:20:22,790 --> 00:20:23,920
report to me immediately.

313
00:20:23,920 --> 00:20:24,480
Got it.

314
00:20:26,200 --> 00:20:26,960
By the way,

315
00:20:28,440 --> 00:20:31,510
Lanxin Theater went to the train station
to cheer on the troops.

316
00:20:31,510 --> 00:20:32,240
What?

317
00:20:33,310 --> 00:20:34,720
Why didn't you tell me sooner?

318
00:20:34,720 --> 00:20:35,680
Wasn't it because

319
00:20:35,680 --> 00:20:38,480
you acted like you had a short fuse
the day after the wedding,

320
00:20:38,480 --> 00:20:39,880
forbidding me from mentioning
Miss Ren's name in front of you-

321
00:20:39,880 --> 00:20:41,680
This concerns the Red Pill case.

322
00:20:42,550 --> 00:20:45,680
And you still have the nerve
to banter with me about this?

323
00:20:45,960 --> 00:20:47,750
Go to the training ground
and do 10 laps of frog jumps.

324
00:20:47,750 --> 00:20:50,880
-But I have to go to the train station...
-Just do as I say.

325
00:20:53,510 --> 00:20:55,510
I'll go to the train station myself.

326
00:21:14,510 --> 00:21:15,240
Who's there?

327
00:21:56,680 --> 00:21:57,830
Where's the lock on the door?

328
00:21:57,830 --> 00:21:58,830
Why is it missing?

329
00:22:10,790 --> 00:22:11,520
Who's there?

330
00:22:57,550 --> 00:22:58,280
Come with me.

331
00:22:59,920 --> 00:23:00,880
Why are you here?

332
00:23:01,350 --> 00:23:02,950
No time to explain. Let's go.

333
00:23:15,960 --> 00:23:17,240
Ladies and gentlemen,

334
00:23:17,350 --> 00:23:19,880
how did you like "The Jinshan Temple"
just now?

335
00:23:19,880 --> 00:23:22,350
Bravo! Perform another one!

336
00:23:24,400 --> 00:23:25,510
In that case,

337
00:23:25,640 --> 00:23:27,000
we'll perform

338
00:23:27,000 --> 00:23:28,240
another piece for you all—

339
00:23:28,240 --> 00:23:29,400
"The Crossroads."

340
00:23:29,790 --> 00:23:31,110
Great!

341
00:23:31,110 --> 00:23:33,370
Without the invitation of the Ying Army,

342
00:23:33,510 --> 00:23:34,270
Boss Hai,

343
00:23:35,640 --> 00:23:38,170
what kind of "cheering on the troops"
is this?

344
00:23:39,590 --> 00:23:40,590
Where is Ren Susu?

345
00:23:42,310 --> 00:23:43,310
Right backstage.

346
00:23:49,200 --> 00:23:50,720
Would you like to see

347
00:23:50,960 --> 00:23:52,200
the Young Marshal's magic tricks?

348
00:23:52,200 --> 00:23:53,310
Yes!

349
00:24:06,310 --> 00:24:07,000
Young Marshal!

350
00:24:07,000 --> 00:24:07,790
Young Marshal!

351
00:24:07,790 --> 00:24:09,200
Wait, wait. No need to panic.

352
00:24:09,200 --> 00:24:10,530
This is part of the show.

353
00:24:11,030 --> 00:24:13,240
Bravo!

354
00:24:21,640 --> 00:24:23,640
Young Marshal, you just couldn't bear
to part with me, could you?

355
00:24:23,640 --> 00:24:26,240
That you had to drag me
into this crappy box with you?

356
00:24:26,240 --> 00:24:27,770
Good thing I was on my guard.

357
00:24:28,790 --> 00:24:32,050
Otherwise, you would've locked me up
in here all by myself.

358
00:24:32,680 --> 00:24:34,340
Since you're already in here,

359
00:24:34,350 --> 00:24:35,480
you might as well

360
00:24:35,960 --> 00:24:37,760
open this crappy box right away.

361
00:24:38,200 --> 00:24:39,200
The box is broken.

362
00:24:39,240 --> 00:24:40,170
We can't get out.

363
00:24:43,200 --> 00:24:44,930
What exactly are you guys up to?

364
00:24:45,550 --> 00:24:47,200
Doing what we're supposed to do.

365
00:24:47,200 --> 00:24:48,440
Unlike certain people

366
00:24:48,440 --> 00:24:49,830
who can't tell right from wrong,

367
00:24:49,830 --> 00:24:51,030
cover things up and turn a blind eye—

368
00:24:51,030 --> 00:24:54,090
a disgrace to the title of
Chief Inspector of Nancheng.

369
00:24:54,590 --> 00:24:55,650
And what about you?

370
00:24:56,240 --> 00:24:58,840
What gives you the right to judge
good and evil?

371
00:24:59,160 --> 00:25:01,200
But at least we dare to pursue the truth.

372
00:25:01,200 --> 00:25:01,920
Do you?

373
00:25:02,350 --> 00:25:03,680
Have you ever done that?

374
00:25:15,160 --> 00:25:16,090
What's the rush?

375
00:25:16,920 --> 00:25:18,070
Does being around me

376
00:25:18,590 --> 00:25:19,680
really bother you that much?

377
00:25:19,680 --> 00:25:20,540
Young Marshal!

378
00:25:20,750 --> 00:25:21,680
What happened?

379
00:25:22,550 --> 00:25:23,410
Young Marshal!

380
00:25:24,640 --> 00:25:26,000
It seems whether I live or die

381
00:25:26,000 --> 00:25:27,550
depends entirely on what you say,
Young Marshal.

382
00:25:27,550 --> 00:25:28,950
Tell them to open the box.

383
00:25:29,160 --> 00:25:30,400
Charge me with whatever crime you like

384
00:25:30,400 --> 00:25:31,530
and throw me in jail.

385
00:25:32,110 --> 00:25:34,910
That way, I won't be able to
go against you anymore.

386
00:25:36,310 --> 00:25:37,170
Young Marshal!

387
00:25:37,270 --> 00:25:38,110
Are you okay?

388
00:25:43,110 --> 00:25:44,240
I'll pry the box open right away!

389
00:25:44,240 --> 00:25:44,830
No need.

390
00:25:47,750 --> 00:25:48,510
I'm fine.

391
00:25:54,200 --> 00:25:55,400
After that incident,

392
00:25:56,920 --> 00:25:58,720
today's the first time
you've spoken to me,

393
00:25:57,880 --> 00:26:00,880
♪ If the sparks ♪

394
00:26:00,900 --> 00:26:03,460
♪ Could fly back into the gun's muzzle ♪

395
00:26:05,030 --> 00:26:06,590
and yet it's still because
you want to use me.

396
00:26:05,620 --> 00:26:10,780
♪ If I had turned away
when love first bloomed ♪

397
00:26:10,480 --> 00:26:13,040
You're just taking advantage of the fact
that I like you, aren't you?

398
00:26:13,040 --> 00:26:18,810
♪ My true heart hides in the shadows,
left to fate's mercy ♪

399
00:26:17,110 --> 00:26:19,310
Now that you've gotten what you wanted,

400
00:26:20,070 --> 00:26:26,060
♪ Resisting the pull of every temptation ♪

401
00:26:20,590 --> 00:26:22,790
it's time for me to take back what I want.

402
00:26:26,720 --> 00:26:29,910
♪ Hate is the smoke left by dying flames ♪

403
00:26:30,330 --> 00:26:33,690
♪ Behind remains
the bitterness of unspoken feelings ♪

404
00:26:33,850 --> 00:26:37,350
♪ The heart races with every thought ♪

405
00:26:37,460 --> 00:26:40,700
♪ As long as we loved each other,
I don't care ♪

406
00:26:40,770 --> 00:26:44,290
♪ If it's a blessing or a curse ♪

407
00:26:47,440 --> 00:26:49,300
Without a plan—do you want to die?

408
00:26:49,790 --> 00:26:51,120
What are you doing here?

409
00:26:51,750 --> 00:26:52,790
You're my wife.

410
00:26:53,110 --> 00:26:54,240
You're out in the middle of the night.

411
00:26:54,240 --> 00:26:57,240
As your husband, don't I have the right
to ask about it?

412
00:27:00,830 --> 00:27:02,480
-Get them!
-Halt!

413
00:27:03,640 --> 00:27:04,270
Stop!

414
00:27:05,480 --> 00:27:06,110
This way!

415
00:27:06,790 --> 00:27:07,590
Catch them!

416
00:27:10,110 --> 00:27:10,510
That way.

417
00:27:10,510 --> 00:27:11,240
Who's there?

418
00:27:11,510 --> 00:27:12,160
Stop!

419
00:27:13,160 --> 00:27:14,440
-Stop!
-Hurry!

420
00:27:17,480 --> 00:27:18,110
Stop!

421
00:27:20,000 --> 00:27:20,720
Catch them!

422
00:27:25,110 --> 00:27:25,710
Over here.

423
00:27:26,830 --> 00:27:27,480
Careful.

424
00:27:28,270 --> 00:27:28,880
Ren Susu,

425
00:27:29,640 --> 00:27:30,370
you go first.

426
00:27:31,030 --> 00:27:31,890
What about you?

427
00:27:33,160 --> 00:27:34,890
Hurry! Don't let them get away!

428
00:27:35,200 --> 00:27:35,930
Don't worry.

429
00:27:36,440 --> 00:27:38,110
With my status,
they won't dare to touch me.

430
00:27:38,110 --> 00:27:38,640
Just go.

431
00:27:48,000 --> 00:27:48,790
Just pretend

432
00:27:50,790 --> 00:27:52,160
you never knew me.

433
00:27:59,960 --> 00:28:00,640
Go!

434
00:28:00,410 --> 00:28:02,270
♪ Sharper pain, deeper mark ♪

435
00:28:02,340 --> 00:28:04,690
♪ Deeper care, greater torment ♪

436
00:28:04,350 --> 00:28:05,030
Let's go.

437
00:28:07,020 --> 00:28:08,890
♪ I won't give up on you ♪

438
00:28:08,960 --> 00:28:10,890
♪ Don't let go of me ♪

439
00:28:09,070 --> 00:28:11,000
Can you just give me one second,

440
00:28:12,310 --> 00:28:13,640
and love me for that one second?

441
00:28:13,600 --> 00:28:15,240
♪ In exchange for my everything ♪

442
00:28:15,270 --> 00:28:17,360
♪ Will you finally be mine? ♪

443
00:28:17,990 --> 00:28:20,400
♪ Give me love and hate ♪

444
00:28:20,400 --> 00:28:21,000
Qingyi!

445
00:28:20,500 --> 00:28:23,600
♪ I can't break free, I can't escape ♪

446
00:28:23,630 --> 00:28:26,060
♪ This, too, can be called
a lifetime together ♪

447
00:28:26,120 --> 00:28:27,260
♪ We ♪

448
00:28:28,120 --> 00:28:30,420
♪ Remain bound by fate until the end ♪

449
00:28:31,070 --> 00:28:35,860
♪ Forevermore ♪

450
00:28:35,110 --> 00:28:36,970
Can you give me just one second...

451
00:28:40,350 --> 00:28:41,310
I told you

452
00:28:41,550 --> 00:28:42,590
I'd be fine.

453
00:28:45,590 --> 00:28:47,160
Le'an finally has a father.

454
00:28:57,880 --> 00:28:59,200
I found this.

455
00:29:06,200 --> 00:29:07,880
The ship on which Godfather met his end

456
00:29:07,880 --> 00:29:08,640
had always

457
00:29:09,240 --> 00:29:12,240
been transporting military supplies
for Li Rongzhang,

458
00:29:12,240 --> 00:29:14,440
but these Red Pills were found mixed in.

459
00:29:16,960 --> 00:29:17,880
Strangely,

460
00:29:18,830 --> 00:29:20,270
the Red Pills on that ship

461
00:29:21,310 --> 00:29:23,440
could cause some terrible illnesses.

462
00:29:29,510 --> 00:29:31,570
After Godfather learned about this,

463
00:29:31,880 --> 00:29:33,880
he set off the explosives on the ship

464
00:29:34,000 --> 00:29:35,460
and sank together with it.

465
00:29:38,750 --> 00:29:41,350
He most likely did so to prevent
that shipment of Red Pills

466
00:29:41,350 --> 00:29:43,240
from falling into the hands of
the general public in Nanyang,

467
00:29:43,240 --> 00:29:45,030
where they would've caused
immeasurable harm.

468
00:29:45,030 --> 00:29:47,160
Back then, I seized a batch of Red Pills

469
00:29:47,720 --> 00:29:49,250
on the southwestern front,

470
00:29:49,960 --> 00:29:53,490
and that was when I began
secretly investigating Li Rongzhang.

471
00:29:53,920 --> 00:29:55,270
The transport route for the Red Pills

472
00:29:55,270 --> 00:29:57,200
necessarily run along
the North-South Railway,

473
00:29:57,200 --> 00:29:58,960
and the tracks and stations along the way

474
00:29:58,960 --> 00:30:00,960
are all controlled by the Ying Army.

475
00:30:01,030 --> 00:30:03,640
Li Rongzhang's only responsible for
transportation.

476
00:30:03,640 --> 00:30:06,440
He doesn't have the skills
to manufacture the pills.

477
00:30:06,440 --> 00:30:07,240
Then who does?

478
00:30:08,680 --> 00:30:09,680
The Zhang family?

479
00:30:10,590 --> 00:30:11,480
Very likely.

480
00:30:12,880 --> 00:30:14,160
On the surface, the Zhang family

481
00:30:14,160 --> 00:30:15,690
runs the gangs in Nancheng,

482
00:30:15,750 --> 00:30:16,920
but they've always been able

483
00:30:16,920 --> 00:30:19,440
to go toe-to-toe with
the warlords and the police.

484
00:30:19,440 --> 00:30:20,440
They must have

485
00:30:20,880 --> 00:30:22,610
overseas backing behind them.

486
00:30:24,070 --> 00:30:25,730
That's just our speculation.

487
00:30:28,400 --> 00:30:29,160
Looks like

488
00:30:30,350 --> 00:30:33,880
we'll have to start investigating
from the source of the drugs.

489
00:30:38,720 --> 00:30:39,520
What's wrong?

490
00:30:40,110 --> 00:30:40,880
Are you hurt?

491
00:30:44,440 --> 00:30:45,110
It's a chronic condition.

492
00:30:45,110 --> 00:30:46,510
What chronic condition?

493
00:30:47,070 --> 00:30:49,670
How come I didn't know
you had an ear condition?

494
00:30:51,510 --> 00:30:52,200
I'm tired.

495
00:31:14,270 --> 00:31:16,600
When we get to the outskirts of Hangcheng,

496
00:31:16,640 --> 00:31:18,770
I'll ask someone to come and pick us up.

497
00:31:20,830 --> 00:31:21,510
Okay.

498
00:31:36,080 --> 00:31:39,410
[Nancheng Station]

499
00:31:40,550 --> 00:31:41,960
Someone broke in last night.

500
00:31:41,960 --> 00:31:43,290
We failed to catch them,

501
00:31:43,440 --> 00:31:45,000
but in the hidden compartment of the box,

502
00:31:45,000 --> 00:31:45,920
we found this.

503
00:31:57,310 --> 00:31:59,070
That bastard Zhang Mingshu.

504
00:31:59,550 --> 00:32:01,750
He actually dared to scheme against me.

505
00:32:08,640 --> 00:32:09,310
Drugs.

506
00:32:10,720 --> 00:32:13,780
You actually dared to mix them
into military supplies.

507
00:32:16,400 --> 00:32:18,600
Look at what your Zhang family has done.

508
00:32:21,270 --> 00:32:22,310
Mr. Li.

509
00:32:24,640 --> 00:32:27,040
How could this be
our Zhang family's doing?

510
00:32:27,270 --> 00:32:29,110
This is clearly your doing.

511
00:32:30,680 --> 00:32:32,150
Over the past few years,
the North-South Railway

512
00:32:32,150 --> 00:32:35,590
has served as a protective network
for transporting Red Pills.

513
00:32:35,590 --> 00:32:37,200
The fact that Red Pills
have spread across the country,

514
00:32:37,200 --> 00:32:39,400
bringing in a steady stream of profits—

515
00:32:39,830 --> 00:32:41,350
that's all thanks to you.

516
00:32:43,000 --> 00:32:44,600
You actually dared to use me.

517
00:32:45,310 --> 00:32:47,510
Aren't you worried I'll blow this open?

518
00:32:48,350 --> 00:32:49,350
Mr. Li.

519
00:32:50,270 --> 00:32:51,720
You've certainly taken quite a cut

520
00:32:51,720 --> 00:32:54,510
from the North–South Railway's
transportation business.

521
00:32:54,510 --> 00:32:57,350
Every gun and every bullet in your army

522
00:32:57,480 --> 00:33:00,350
was paid for with the profits we made
from selling Red Pills.

523
00:33:00,350 --> 00:33:01,750
Isn't it also the Red Pills

524
00:33:01,750 --> 00:33:03,070
that allow you to keep the Murong family

525
00:33:03,070 --> 00:33:04,750
in check right now?

526
00:33:05,590 --> 00:33:06,310
This...

527
00:33:10,200 --> 00:33:11,350
This is no drug.

528
00:33:12,680 --> 00:33:14,160
This is your military funding,

529
00:33:14,160 --> 00:33:15,420
your guns and cannons,

530
00:33:15,510 --> 00:33:18,570
as well as your food, clothing,
and daily necessities.

531
00:33:20,510 --> 00:33:21,720
If this gets out,

532
00:33:22,200 --> 00:33:25,680
you won't be able to keep your position
as Governor of the North-South Railway.

533
00:33:25,680 --> 00:33:27,070
Let's see if the Ying Army

534
00:33:27,070 --> 00:33:29,270
can withstand the wrath
of all of Nancheng,

535
00:33:29,270 --> 00:33:30,750
or even the entire nation.

536
00:33:33,110 --> 00:33:34,200
In the end,

537
00:33:35,110 --> 00:33:36,350
I really can't say

538
00:33:36,920 --> 00:33:38,480
who'll go down first.

539
00:33:39,720 --> 00:33:40,440
Besides,

540
00:33:40,720 --> 00:33:44,980
as for the pharmaceutical factory,
our Zhang family only holds a tiny stake.

541
00:33:48,240 --> 00:33:49,790
The real owners

542
00:33:50,160 --> 00:33:51,420
are in the concession.

543
00:33:53,550 --> 00:33:55,950
You don't need me to remind you
who's behind

544
00:33:57,790 --> 00:34:00,120
the East Asia Chamber of Commerce, do you?

545
00:34:01,960 --> 00:34:04,200
Not to mention you, a mere Governor,

546
00:34:04,720 --> 00:34:05,960
even the government

547
00:34:05,960 --> 00:34:08,090
wouldn't dare confront them head-on.

548
00:34:09,440 --> 00:34:11,440
If you really go all out
and ruin everything,

549
00:34:11,440 --> 00:34:13,500
you'll end up with nothing in the end,

550
00:34:13,760 --> 00:34:16,620
and you won't be able to
walk away unscathed either.

551
00:34:17,840 --> 00:34:20,639
But if you choose to cooperate
for mutual benefit,

552
00:34:20,760 --> 00:34:22,760
what it can bring you is far greater.

553
00:34:32,670 --> 00:34:35,330
This son of yours
is even more ruthless than you.

554
00:34:42,000 --> 00:34:45,590
Your whole family are thugs who go around
wielding sticks and picking fights,

555
00:34:45,590 --> 00:34:47,920
yet just because
you're wearing silk robes now,

556
00:34:47,920 --> 00:34:50,800
you think you can sit at the table
with the big players,

557
00:34:50,800 --> 00:34:52,860
playing games of power and strategy?

558
00:34:54,320 --> 00:34:55,110
What a joke.

559
00:34:56,880 --> 00:34:58,010
Let me tell you this:

560
00:34:59,000 --> 00:35:00,150
I, Li Rongzhang,

561
00:35:00,150 --> 00:35:02,150
am not afraid of going down with you.

562
00:35:03,960 --> 00:35:05,510
Even if it costs me my life,

563
00:35:12,030 --> 00:35:13,830
I'll make sure your Zhang family

564
00:35:14,550 --> 00:35:15,960
goes down with me.

565
00:35:28,510 --> 00:35:29,960
Ren Susu's ear was injured.

566
00:35:29,960 --> 00:35:31,760
Find out exactly what happened.

567
00:35:40,920 --> 00:35:41,590
Get in.

568
00:35:46,670 --> 00:35:48,330
Since you don't want to see me,

569
00:35:48,590 --> 00:35:50,390
this is the only way I can see you.

570
00:35:52,280 --> 00:35:53,880
Just say what you came to say.

571
00:35:55,000 --> 00:35:57,400
You can take a horse to the water
but you cannot make it drink.

572
00:35:57,400 --> 00:35:59,460
You shouldn't have married Ren Susu,

573
00:35:59,550 --> 00:36:01,550
and you especially shouldn't
have made it public.

574
00:36:01,550 --> 00:36:03,110
Whether a horse will drink or not,

575
00:36:03,110 --> 00:36:04,840
you won't know
until you take it to the water.

576
00:36:04,840 --> 00:36:06,000
Anyway, Ren Le'an

577
00:36:06,070 --> 00:36:07,030
is my son.

578
00:36:08,630 --> 00:36:10,090
So you found out after all.

579
00:36:12,590 --> 00:36:15,760
From now on, stop pretending
to be a loving father in front of my son.

580
00:36:15,760 --> 00:36:16,880
If you really want to be a father,

581
00:36:16,880 --> 00:36:18,340
go have a child of your own.

582
00:36:25,920 --> 00:36:26,520
By the way,

583
00:36:27,550 --> 00:36:30,000
now that you know Li Rongzhang
was involved in drug trafficking,

584
00:36:30,000 --> 00:36:31,800
are you going to take any action?

585
00:36:32,110 --> 00:36:33,170
That batch of drugs

586
00:36:33,440 --> 00:36:36,920
has always been supplied by
the Zhang family's pharmaceutical factory

587
00:36:36,920 --> 00:36:39,030
and transported via
the North-South Railway.

588
00:36:39,030 --> 00:36:41,360
But the things hidden among the shipments

589
00:36:41,510 --> 00:36:44,110
may not necessarily
have been known to my father.

590
00:36:44,110 --> 00:36:45,230
Now that he knows,

591
00:36:45,840 --> 00:36:47,100
what does he plan to do?

592
00:36:59,760 --> 00:37:01,560
This is the sample of this batch.

593
00:37:02,400 --> 00:37:03,440
A preliminary inspection

594
00:37:03,440 --> 00:37:04,770
shows something's off.

595
00:37:05,070 --> 00:37:07,150
They're not quite the same
as the ones that have circulated before.

596
00:37:07,150 --> 00:37:08,480
Go seal up the warehouse

597
00:37:08,510 --> 00:37:09,570
and impound these.

598
00:37:09,840 --> 00:37:12,970
Under no circumstances can we
let them enter the market.

599
00:37:14,550 --> 00:37:16,950
So you want me
to investigate my own father?

600
00:37:19,150 --> 00:37:19,960
What?

601
00:37:21,110 --> 00:37:23,040
You don't dare to investigate him?

602
00:37:24,550 --> 00:37:25,510
Even if you don't,

603
00:37:25,510 --> 00:37:26,710
someone else will.

604
00:37:27,070 --> 00:37:28,070
It'll be even harder
to clean up the mess then.

605
00:37:28,070 --> 00:37:31,130
My father did raise us
for more than 10 years, after all.

606
00:37:32,040 --> 00:37:34,010
♪ The more passionate ♪

607
00:37:34,040 --> 00:37:36,130
♪ Our past embrace ♪

608
00:37:37,360 --> 00:37:38,840
When did the upright and honorable
Inspector Li

609
00:37:38,830 --> 00:37:40,560
♪ The more icy ♪

610
00:37:39,000 --> 00:37:40,640
lose his sense of right and wrong?

611
00:37:40,640 --> 00:37:42,550
♪ Our present clash ♪

612
00:37:42,190 --> 00:37:43,190
Or

613
00:37:44,150 --> 00:37:45,070
is your sense of justice

614
00:37:44,680 --> 00:37:46,940
♪ If not tangled in love ♪

615
00:37:45,670 --> 00:37:47,200
conditional to begin with?

616
00:37:47,470 --> 00:37:50,110
♪ We are locked in hate ♪

617
00:37:51,070 --> 00:37:54,950
♪ There is no escaping it ♪

618
00:37:51,230 --> 00:37:52,320
Qingyu once said

619
00:37:52,630 --> 00:37:54,070
that it was because of you and me

620
00:37:54,070 --> 00:37:55,440
that the Murong and Li families

621
00:37:55,440 --> 00:37:56,710
share such a deep bond.

622
00:37:57,150 --> 00:37:58,360
So we're supposed to be
as close as one family.

623
00:37:58,360 --> 00:37:59,480
As close as one family?

624
00:37:58,640 --> 00:38:00,370
♪ Sharper pain, deeper mark ♪

625
00:38:00,190 --> 00:38:01,920
When the nest is destroyed,
no egg can remain intact.

626
00:38:00,400 --> 00:38:02,550
♪ Deeper care, greater torment ♪

627
00:38:02,110 --> 00:38:02,840
Li Boze,

628
00:38:03,800 --> 00:38:04,710
do you really think you can call the shots

629
00:38:04,710 --> 00:38:06,070
for the Murong and Li families?

630
00:38:05,290 --> 00:38:07,020
♪ I won't give up on you ♪

631
00:38:07,120 --> 00:38:09,110
♪ Don't let go of me ♪

632
00:38:11,140 --> 00:38:13,910
♪ Let the ropes of fate ♪

633
00:38:13,550 --> 00:38:15,510
You've been playing the loyal lapdog
out there every day,

634
00:38:13,940 --> 00:38:16,740
♪ Bind you and me ♪

635
00:38:16,030 --> 00:38:17,440
to the point that you've abandoned
even the most basic principles

636
00:38:17,440 --> 00:38:18,150
of truth and justice?

637
00:38:17,810 --> 00:38:20,320
♪ Even if led to a precipice ♪

638
00:38:20,380 --> 00:38:22,800
♪ Together, we fall ♪

639
00:38:21,590 --> 00:38:24,120
Don't you love to bring up Qingyu
all the time?

640
00:38:24,150 --> 00:38:25,590
Then go to his grave
and take a close look at

641
00:38:25,370 --> 00:38:26,760
♪ Must it take heartache ♪

642
00:38:26,110 --> 00:38:28,030
what's inscribed on his tombstone.

643
00:38:26,810 --> 00:38:28,580
♪ To know my heart belongs to you? ♪

644
00:38:29,480 --> 00:38:31,600
♪ Hearts cold no more ♪

645
00:38:31,700 --> 00:38:34,890
♪ I can't break free, I can't escape ♪

646
00:38:34,990 --> 00:38:37,380
♪ This, too, can be called
a lifetime together ♪

647
00:38:37,150 --> 00:38:37,710
Fine.

648
00:38:37,470 --> 00:38:38,790
♪ We ♪

649
00:38:39,110 --> 00:38:40,070
If you won't investigate,

650
00:38:39,700 --> 00:38:41,610
♪ Remain bound by fate until the end ♪

651
00:38:40,550 --> 00:38:41,550
I'll do it for you.

652
00:38:42,500 --> 00:38:48,590
♪ Forevermore ♪
